# Keep the production image build context small and free of secret or local material (functional-repair phase, WS-F review).
# Everything the build needs is NOT listed here: src, public, index.html, package files, tsconfig*, vite configs, scripts,
# AND frontend/.env.production, whose public VITE_* values (API base URL, prices, methodology version) are inlined into the bundle at build time.
# (Vite only ever exposes VITE_* variables, so no secret may be placed in a frontend .env file.)
node_modules
dist
.vite
coverage
*.log
npm-debug.log*
.git
*.pem
*.key
*.dump
.qa-credentials*
.DS_Store
